Notes on third-party components:

- The NVIDIA vGPU host driver (535.161.05) is proprietary software owned by
  NVIDIA Corporation and is governed by its own license agreement. It is NOT
  distributed by this repository; the deployment scripts download it at
  runtime from a community mirror or accept a user-supplied copy.

- patches/nvidia-535.161.05-linux7.0.patch is original work released under MIT.

- The consumer-GPU unlock patch is fetched at runtime from
  https://gitlab.com/polloloco/vgpu-proxmox (AGPL-3.0) and is not redistributed here.

- vgpu_unlock-rs is fetched at runtime from
  https://github.com/mbilker/vgpu_unlock-rs and is not redistributed here.

- fastapi-dls is fetched at runtime from
  https://git.collinwebdesigns.de/oscar.krause/fastapi-dls and is not
  redistributed here.
